  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6aadde69f514c7545ac8b7ebefed8893, type: 3}
  m_Name: FactsData_Room1_Open
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  facts:
  - An open system exchanges both matter and energy with its surroundings.
  - "Boiling water in an open pot loses steam \u2014 that's matter leaving the system!"
  - "A car engine is an open system \u2014 it takes in fuel and releases exhaust."
  - "Living things like humans are open systems \u2014 we eat, breathe and release
    energy."
  - A burning candle exchanges both heat and wax vapour with the surroundings.
